Subject: [PATCH 0/2] regulator: add Samsung S2MPB03 camera PMIC driver
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The Samsung S2MPB03 is a small camera power management IC that exposes
seven LDO regulators over I2C. It is used on Samsung boards such as the
Galaxy A52 (SM7125) to power the camera sensors.

No public datasheet is available; the register map and per-LDO voltage
ranges are taken from the Samsung downstream driver and were verified on
a Galaxy A52.

Patch 1 adds the device tree binding, patch 2 the driver.

Miroslav Mráz (2):
